5;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">{{first_name}}<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">I&#x27;ve written twice now, so I&#x27;ll take the hint that the timing might just be wrong — a busy season, a full plate, or Patina isn&#x27;t a this-month thing.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">No trouble at all. If there&#x27;s a better month, reply with it and I&#x27;ll hold your invitation open until then. If I don&#x27;t hear back, that&#x27;s fine too — this is the last of these you&#x27;ll get from me. No drip, no chasing.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">The door stays open either way.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:22px 0 0 0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-style:italic;color:#4B463E">— Kody</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:34px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><div class="hairbg" style="height:1px;background-color:#E6DDCC;font-size:0;line-height:0"> </div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:22px 40px 32px"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr s