"0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="vertical-align:middle"><p class="wordmark" style="font-size:23px;line-height:24px;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1F1B16">Patina</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:22px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">{{first_name}}<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">Once work is signed, the money has its own quiet order.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">Accounts is one sheet. A signed proposal becomes a deposit invoice in about two minutes — the numbers are already there. Your receivables sit in one view: what&#x27;s out, what&#x27;s paid, what&#x27;s late. Reminders go out on their own, so you are not the one nagging a client about a balance.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">Orders is the other sheet. Every purchase order carries its maker, its dates, and its status, so “where&#x27;s the credenza” has an answer you can read off a screen instead of chasing down a workshop.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">Both sheets slide over the document when you need them and slide back when you&#x27;re done. The ledgers serve the work — the work never bends to the ledgers.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">If anything of yours is signed, send the deposit invoice today. It&#x27;s the shortest path from yes to money in.</p><div style="margin:28px 0;text-align:left"><a href="{{app_url}}/desk?sheet=accounts" style="line-height:1;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:7px;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.01em;text-align:center;padding:15px 32px 15px 32px;background-color:#1F1B16;color:#F5F0E6;border:1px solid #1F1B16" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:22.5" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:11.25px">Open Accounts</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></div><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:22px 0 0 0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-style:italic;color:#4B463E">— Kody</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:34px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><div class="hairbg" style="height:1px;background-color:#E6DDCC;font-size:0;line-height:0"> </div>