}</style></head><body class="bg" style="background-color:#F5F0E6;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin:0;padding:24px 12px"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0">What you&#x27;ve set up, what&#x27;s ahead, and one ask.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table align="center" width="100%" class="container shell" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;width:600px;background-color:#FCF9F2;border:1px solid #E6DDCC;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="height:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;background-color:#4E7A66"> </td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="height:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;background-color:#B08A46"> </td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="height:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;background-color:#A24E2E"> </td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:26px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="vertical-align:middle"><p class="wordmark" style="font-size:23px;line-height:24px;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1F1B16">Patina</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:22px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">{{first_name}}<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">Six weeks. Here&#x27;s what you&#x27;ve actually done — pulled from your own record, not a brochure:</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">{{firsts_summary}}</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">That&#x27;s a practice starting to run on one set of pages instead of six browser tabs and your memory.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">You were one of the first designers we asked in, and that wasn&#x27;t a courtesy. What snagged for you, what felt obvious, what didn&#x27;t — it&#x27;s shaping what we build next. The founding cohort is small on purpose, so each voice actually moves things.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">So, one ask: reply and tell me the roughest edge you hit in these six weeks. Not the tidy version — the real one. I read every reply on this address, and the rough ones are the useful ones.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">This is the last of the onboarding notes. From here it&#x27;s the Founding Circle letter once a month and the weekly digest — both easy to leave whenever you like. The desk is yours to keep.</p><div style="margin:28px 0;text-align:left"><a href="{{app_url}}/desk" style="line-height:1;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;border-radius:7px;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.01em;text-align:center;padding:15px 32px 15px 32px;background-color:#1F1B16;color:#F5F0E6;border:1px solid #1F1B16" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%;mso-text-raise:22.5" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:11.25px">Back to the desk</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:400%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></div><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:22px 0 0 0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-style:italic;color:#4B463E">— Kody<br/>Founder, Patina</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:34px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><div class="hairbg" style="height:1px;background-color:#E6DDCC;font-size:0;line-height:0"> </div></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:22px 40px 32px"><tbody><tr><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="vertical-align:top"><p class="ink2" style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 5px;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;color:#4B463E">Patina</p><p class="ink3" style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#8C8578">A workshop for interior designers<br/>and the makers they trust.</p></td><td align="right" data-id="__react-email-column" style="vertical-align:top"><a href="https://app.patina.cloud" style="color:#4E7A66;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Dashboard</a><br/><a href="https://app.patina.cloud/help" style="color:#4E7A66;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Help center</a><br/><a href="https://app.patina.cloud/portal/settings/notifications" style="color:#4E7A66;text-decoration-line:none;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Email preferences</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:600px;width:600px"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><p class="ink3" style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;IBM Plex Mono&#x27;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &#x27;Courier New&#x27;, monospace;letter-spacing:0.03em;color:#8C8578;text-align:center;padding:18px 40px 10px">Patina  ·  <!-- -->A workshop for interior designers and the makers they trust.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>$html$, $html$["first_name","firsts_summary"]$html$::jsonb, true),
