ter" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td align="left" data-id="__react-email-column" style="vertical-align:middle"><p class="wordmark" style="font-size:23px;line-height:24px;margin:0;font-family:&#x27;Fraunces&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#1F1B16">Patina</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" class="px" style="padding:22px 40px 0"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">{{first_name}}<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">A payment cleared. It&#x27;s recorded against the client, reconciled in Accounts, and sitting in your receivables as paid — nothing left for you to file.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">This is also the moment the Pledge stops being a line in a welcome letter: a quarter of our commission goes back to the designers who teach the system — and what Patina earned on this payment is part of that promise.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:&#x27;Hanken Grotesk&#x27;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;color:#4B463E">First money through the books is a quiet milestone, but it&#x27;s the one the whole thing is built to reach. Well earned.</p><div style="margin:28px 0;text-align:left"><a